#: ../../source/manufacturing/3d_printing/specific_skill_guides/extruder_calibration/extruder_calibration.rst:2
msgid "Extruder Calibration (E-Steps)"
msgstr "押出機キャリブレーション (E-Steps)"

#: ../../source/manufacturing/3d_printing/specific_skill_guides/extruder_calibration/extruder_calibration.rst:4
msgid ""
"If you're noticing any issues with over/under extrusion or if you just got a"
" new printer, it's highly advisable that you tune your e-steps. E-Steps "
"dictate how many steps the extruder motor takes to extrude a certain amount "
"of filament. This procedure is best covered in videos, so go take a look at "
"`Thomas Sanladerer's video on the topic. "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YUPfBJz3I6Y>`_"
msgstr ""
"過剰押出しまたは不足押出しの問題に気付いた場合や、新しいプリンターを手に入れたばかりの場合は、e-ステップを調整することを強くお勧めします。E-ステップは、押出機モーターが特定の量のフィラメントを押出すために必要なステップ数を決定します。この手順は動画で説明されるのが最適ですので、"
" `Thomas Sanladerer's video on the topic. "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YUPfBJz3I6Y>`_ をご覧ください。"
